'''Traveler's Axe''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 30th tier in the Battle Pass for 30,000 [[Candies (2023)|Candies]] {{Currency|Candies2023}} during the [[Halloween Event 2023|2023 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
It takes the design of a battleaxe, but with a Halloween theme and one blade being significantly larger than the other. Each blade of the axe is magma orange, connected by a dark spike-like metallic clip, with green vines all over them. These blades connect to the jack-o-lantern in the center, along with the vines. The handle is a jagged stick of wood with vines wrapping around it, along with a sharp magma orange pommel.  

==Trivia==
*It is the 11th [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] weapon to be added into the game and the fourth to resemble an axe, the others being [[Logchopper]], [[Icebreaker]] and [[Swirly Axe]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Traveler's Gun]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Traveler Set|Traveler Set]].
*This knife has a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] counterpart named [[Traveler (Knife)|Traveler]].
*There are [[Red Traveler's Axe|red]], [[Bronze Traveler's Axe|bronze]], [[Silver Traveler's Axe|silver]] and [[Gold Traveler's Axe|gold]] counterparts of this knife, made for the 2023 Halloween leaderboard.

